Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:55.62,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\c&H3356C4&\t(3900,4650,\c&H000000&)\fs55\pos(1068.61,460)}整蛊{\c&H0D1620&\t(3900,4650,\c&H000000&)}泷奈\N{\c&H2784CD&\t(3900,4650,\c&H000000&)}大作战
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.61,0:00:09.21,CN,,55,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}幽灵干的？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.93,0:00:11.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}搞什么啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.46,0:00:13.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}千束说的吗
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.23,0:00:14.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}瑞希小姐也这么说
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.87,0:00:18.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}幽灵啊 我可从没见过
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.47,0:00:19.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}骗人的吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.32,0:00:23.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}没关系 摄像头可不会说谎
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.10,0:00:25.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}要开始了哦
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.75,0:00:33.89,CN,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}藏到哪里…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.75,0:00:35.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}你要掩盖证据是吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.48,0:00:36.34,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}瑞希
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.34,0:00:39.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}看来得让老师打你屁股才行了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.76,0:00:44.00,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}不不 你不也把店里的酒拿回家了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.95,0:00:47.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}我们是罪人
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.93,0:00:49.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}不要拿我和你… 一身酒味
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.62,0:00:51.50,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}别闹了 快住手
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.50,0:00:52.45,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}才不一样呢
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.45,0:00:54.61,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}我带的都是好酒
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.61,0:00:55.93,CN - Top,,58,500,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}你不会说出去吧？会保密的吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.61,0:00:55.93,CN - Top,,900,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}不…不是
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.93,0:00:58.09,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}好啦我知道了 就这一次哦
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.89,0:01:01.17,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}你也挺坏的嘛
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.05,0:01:04.51,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}是馒头欸
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.62,0:00:53.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}看吧 我就知道是这么回事
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.09,0:01:02.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}你听到了吗 是幽灵掩盖了证据
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.28,0:01:09.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}找到鬼了吗 要倒回去吗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.14,0:01:11.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}不 没什么
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.31,0:01:15.16,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}客人 这就是护发素的效果哟
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.16,0:01:17.07,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}是不是很顺滑
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.07,0:01:19.86,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}怎么样 您要买吗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.86,0:01:22.71,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}不了 我觉得平时应该用不着
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.71,0:01:23.78,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}为什么啊
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.15,0:01:17.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}你们在搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.07,0:01:18.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}你看成什么了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.80,0:01:21.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}只是在让她帮我梳头而已
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.32,0:01:25.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}这是什么
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.83,0:01:26.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}哪个
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.62,0:01:28.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}这里 这里
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.37,0:01:29.91,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}健壮的肌肉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.63,0:01:32.03,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}珠穆朗玛峰
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.03,0:01:34.95,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}看 砰
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.44,0:01:32.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}他在看摄像头
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.99,0:01:33.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}暴露了啊
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.90,0:01:36.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}下一个 下一个
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.22,0:01:39.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}你能不能… 你是不是又胖了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.80,0:01:41.09,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}你杀人了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.09,0:01:42.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}笨蛋 仔细看
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}啊 是瑞希小姐
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.30,0:01:45.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.39,0:01:49.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}有人投诉 说店门口躺着一具尸体
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.23,0:01:52.74,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}我还没死呢 我才{\fscx25}　{\fscx}20{\fscx25}　{\fscx}多岁
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.74,0:01:56.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}倒是你多大年纪了 Walnut
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.52,0:01:59.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}闭嘴 赶紧把这家伙毙了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.75,0:02:02.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}别吵了 现在是深夜
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.67,0:02:05.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}这附近有没有{\fscx25}　{\fscx}Lycoris
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.36,0:02:06.41,CN,,58,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}你看到了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.41,0:02:08.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}看到了 拍到了什么东西
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.91,0:02:10.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}等等 看看其他摄像头
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.62,0:02:49.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}喝下了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.15,0:02:53.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}泷奈 等等…等等
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.39,0:02:54.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}是…是我们
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.80,0:02:57.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}没错 你快看牌子
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.03,0:02:59.03,CN,,57,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}整…整蛊？
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}对…对对对对
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.25,0:03:03.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我还以为要死了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.22,0:03:04.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}这话该我说才对
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.70,0:03:06.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}我的腰
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.25,0:03:08.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}好像闪到了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.31,0:03:11.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}哎 每次吓唬泷奈都要赌命啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.98,0:03:14.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}不过 倒是听到了不错的叫声
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.99,0:03:21.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}不信灵异现象的人可不会发出那样的声音
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.27,0:03:24.19,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}对吧 幽灵是真的存在的 泷奈
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.19,0:03:27.15,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}别闹了 把酒钱和餐具赔偿留下来再走
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.15,0:03:30.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}够了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.89,0:03:33.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}对了 胡桃去哪了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.03,0:03:35.19,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}早上出门后就没回来
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.90,0:03:39.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}那刚刚是谁 不是一直和我们在一起吗
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.36,0:03:40.58,CN,,57,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}谁啊？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.58,0:03:41.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}胡桃
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.07,0:03:43.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}她…她刚刚不是在吗
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.32,0:03:44.79,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}不…不在啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.19,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}她…她刚才在的吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.19,0:03:46.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}在哪里
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.76,0:03:48.93,CN,,0,600,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}喂喂
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.43,0:03:48.93,CN,,600,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}和我在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.93,0:03:50.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}可她不在啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.21,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}她在的
